SovNode modified this project beginning 2026-08-29, migrating it to
Spring Boot 4.1.1 on Java 21 and reworking dependencies, security
boundaries, configuration, and the test suite. This NOTICE identifies
those modifications at the project level. The public repository is a
clean release snapshot derived from upstream eladmin commit 55fbf70.

File level notice coverage: every substantively modified inherited
source file relative to upstream base 55fbf70 carries a "Modified by
SovNode in 2026 (Spring Boot 4.1 modernization); see NOTICE." comment
adjacent to the upstream copyright header or XML declaration. Files
whose only difference is whitespace normalization remain covered by
the upstream notice and this project level NOTICE. README.md is a full
SovNode rewrite that carries SovNode authorship and references this
NOTICE in its license and attribution section.
eladmin-system/src/main/resources/banner.txt has no comment syntax: the
file is printed verbatim at every application start, so an in-file
marker would corrupt the startup banner. It remains attributed here.

